====Verb====
{{enm-verb|beteth|betynge|bet|beten}}

# To [[beat]]; to [[repeatedly]] [[strike]] or [[hit]]:
## To [[hit]] or [[whip]]; to [[attack]] with a [[blunt]] [[weapon]] or the [[hand]]s:
