## To [[strike]] [[metal]] into [[shape]]; to [[perform]] [[metalworking]].
## To [[throb]] or [[vibrate]]; to make a [[regular]] [[pulse]].
## {{lb|enm|rare}} To [[thresh]]; to separate [[grain]] from the [[chaff]].
# {{lb|enm|especially|cooking}} To [[crush]], [[grind]] or [[mix]]; to cause to lose form.
# To [[decorate]] with [[embroidery]], [[metalwork]], or [[paintwork]].
# To [[beat]] {{gloss|[[conquer]], [[ruin]], or [[overcome]]}}.
# {{lb|enm|figurative}} To [[inflict]] [[punishment]] [[upon]] someone.
# {{lb|enm|rare}} To be [[near]] or [[adjacent]]; to [[border]].
# {{lb|enm|of a quarry|rare}} To [[enter]] a [[waterbody]] so a [[hunting]] [[hound]] loses [[scent]].
# {{lb|enm|figurative|rare}} To [[talk]] or [[converse]] about.

